- Basic Android camera capture at 1080p/60fps
- Basic Mac video reception and virtual camera
- WiFi discovery as backup connection
- OBS compatibility testing

### Phase 2: Polish & Optimization (Weeks 5-6)
- UI/UX refinement
- Performance optimization for 60fps streaming
- Connection stability improvements (especially USB)
