- Latency optimization for OBS use case

### Phase 3: Testing & Launch (Weeks 7-8)
- Beta testing program (focus on OBS users)
- Bug fixes
- Documentation (including OBS setup guide)
- Store submission (Google Play, website distribution for Mac)

## Technical Challenges & Solutions

### Challenge 1: USB Connection Stability
**Problem**: USB connections can be interrupted, ADB setup complexity
**Solution**: Robust USB device detection, clear user instructions for USB debugging setup, automatic reconnection on cable issues

### Challenge 2: Virtual Camera Driver on macOS
**Problem**: macOS security restrictions on system extensions
**Solution**: Use CoreMediaIO DAL plugin, properly signed with Apple Developer certificate

### Challenge 3: 60fps Performance
**Problem**: High frame rate requires significant processing power and can cause overheating
**Solution**: Hardware encoder optimization on Android, efficient decoding on Mac, temperature monitoring with quality fallback

### Challenge 4: USB vs WiFi Architecture
**Problem**: Two completely different data transport mechanisms
**Solution**: Abstracted transport layer with common video pipeline, automatic connection type detection

### Challenge 5: OBS Integration Quality
**Problem**: Maintaining video quality through entire pipeline to OBS
**Solution**: Minimal compression, proper color space support, consistent frame timing, no additional processing overhead

